			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>A workbench of live apps: one big app and up to five mini tiles. Tap a mini and it changes places with the big one.

To open it, slide a finger in from the edge of the screen just above the bottom corner (or up along that edge). Or hold an app's icon on the Home Screen and choose Open in Atelier.

The pill with three dots above the big app is its menu: Full Screen, Switch Layout, Replace App, Close App, Save as Set. Hold a mini for its own menu. A swipe up from the bottom of the screen puts the bench away.</string>
